  "subject": "A Chiayi taxi driver phones the noon Taigi request show from the station rank every day with a dedication list so long the host always cuts him off before the last name, his wife's, until the day he reads it backwards.",
  "caption": "Taiwanese Hokkien keroncong, Indonesian-style slow romantic ballad with an offbeat strummed pulse. Nylon-string cak ukulele and steel-string cuk ukulele strumming interlocking offbeat patterns; cello playing walking pizzicato bass; violin carrying sweet legato counter-lines between phrases; flute answering with soft ornamented fills; nylon guitar picking a gentle arpeggio under the verses. Warm vintage radio-room mix, close wooden strings, soft room reverb. Warm male tenor, open chest voice, gentle and unhurried, clearly sung melody. Clear full voice, every word enunciated, steady sung melody on every line. 92 BPM, F major. Tender, nostalgic, shy-proud devotion with a grin. No rap, no trap hi-hats, no autotune, no electric drums, no EDM drop, no spoken patter.",
  "lyrics": "[Verse]\n中晝十二點 車停佇車頭\n手機仔攑起來 撥去電台\n點歌單 我寫甲滿滿\n一張紙仔 寫甲圓圓\n\n[Pre-Chorus]\n主持人講 阿伯時間無夠\n我才欲講 上尾彼个名\n\n[Chorus]\n上尾彼个名 閣無喝著\n彼个名 比規張單較重\n全世界 攏聽有\n單單伊 聽無\n\n[Verse]\n點予隔壁 賣豆花的\n點予車行 彼个老闆\n點予欠我錢的 彼个朋友\n連隔壁的狗 都有一條歌\n\n[Pre-Chorus]\n主持人閣講 阿伯下擺\n我捀著電話 笑咧笑\n\n[Chorus]\n上尾彼个名 閣無喝著\n彼个名 比規張單較重\n逐工等 逐工喝\n煞攏喝袂到伊\n\n[Verse]\n今仔日 我倒轉來唸\n第一个 就是阿玉\n主持人煞無話 恬一下\n放一條 慢慢仔的歌\n\n[Bridge]\n伊佇灶跤 煮飯 聽著\n鼎蓋擔起來 笑一下\n\n[Chorus]\n上頭前彼个名 喝出去\n彼个名 比規張單較重\n全世界 攏聽有\n這擺 伊嘛聽著\n\n[Outro]\n阿玉 阿玉\n這條歌 點予你",
